# Required follow-ups

- In the next meridian-cli release, add
  `sandbox_workspace_write.network_access` to
  `CODEX_RESERVED_NATIVE_CONFIG_KEYS`. The native-wins logic has one owner:
  delete `CodexPermissions.network_override`, `CodexNetworkOverride`, and the
  `_network_override()` resolution in `permissions_codex.py`. Also delete the
  adapter's `deprecated_codex_network_access_native_config` /
  `invalid_codex_network_access_native_config` warnings and the deprecation
  suffix in `native_config.py`. From that release onward, `network` is the sole
  owner, like `sandbox_workspace_write.writable_roots` today.
